      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她再度陷入沉默，安静地仰望枯木……我莫名犹豫，\n觉得不该就这样离开，于是便留下与她一起守护树叶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7067a36ffb9bce76c3168c5f89d4e7695f03c03ac0c5132d9c3e285963acef4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
